node_modules
dist
dist-*
.DS_Store
*.local
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
# CI e2e 빌드용 더미 값 — 실 크레덴셜 아님(워크플로가 .env.local로 복사해 쓴다).
!.env.ci
.vite
*.tsbuildinfo
# pnpm 저장소 — npm lockfile이 tracked로 남으면 보안 스캐너가 그걸 진실로 읽어
# pnpm-workspace.yaml의 minimumReleaseAge 정책을 우회한다.
package-lock.json
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/projects/
test-results
playwright-report
.wrangler
*.zip
# 커버리지 리포트 본체는 무시하되, git-tracked 트렌드 베이스라인은 커밋한다.
coverage/*
!coverage/baseline.json

# git worktree 체크아웃 (다른 브랜치 사본 — 커밋·테스트 수집 대상 아님)
.worktrees/

# Local agent/runtime definitions and configuration. Recreate with the local roster CLI.
**/.agents/
**/.claude/
**/.codex/
**/.pi/
**/.grok/
**/.cursor/rules/
**/.opencode/agents/
**/.zcode/agents/
**/.hermes/agents/
**/.kimi-code/agents/
**/.roster/
**/.roster-manifest.json
**/.cadre-manifest.json

# Local work artifacts; never include environment credentials, captures, or handoff logs.
.env.local
.env.*.local
handoff/
captures/
local-captures/
*.log

# Disabled upstream automation retained only in this local checkout for recovery.
.github/workflows/trigger-web-deploy.yml
scripts/sync-agents.mjs

# Optional local scaffolds from roster init; public context is maintained in AGENTS.md.
.fallowrc.jsonc
visual-regression.yml
CONTEXT.md
.out-of-scope/

# roster-generated (agent IP — regenerate with `roster deploy`, don't commit)
